== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjörutíu]]'' meaning "[[forty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[fimm]]'' "[[five]]". Meaning '''forty and five'''.
=== Cardinal number ===
'''fjörutíu og fimm''' {{indecl}}

# [[forty-five]], cardinal number after [[fjörutíu og fjórir]] and before [[fjörutíu og sex]]

